{"id":"604471","name":"葱油拌面","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/604471/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条","amount":"285克"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"40克"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：面条、香葱（已去根洗净切成段）、熟白芝麻。","img":"images/604471/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入香葱用中小火翻炒翻炒至微黄。","img":"images/604471/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"随后，加适量的生抽。","img":"images/604471/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的老抽。","img":"images/604471/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的白糖。","img":"images/604471/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒匀，盛出。","img":"images/604471/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入碗中。","img":"images/604471/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接着，将面条下入沸水锅中煮开。","img":"images/604471/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"第一次加入清水。","img":"images/604471/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/604471/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"第二次加入清水。","img":"images/604471/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再次煮开。","img":"images/604471/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"关火，捞出。","img":"images/604471/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/604471/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"然后，加入葱油汁，搁入适量的熟白芝麻即成。","img":"images/604471/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}